  {
   "id": "IXZyAAohyR4J",
   "from": "William Beasley",
   "author": "8ffd6137fd43c6df",
   "date": "2014-03-19T19:21:46Z",
   "subject": "Re: Gant Charts",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12px;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To build on Roman&#39;s geom_rect example, this Gantt-ish <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031106000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gs_ceVVy0-A-H7L045xhG\">graph</a> was created from this <a href=\"http://Cohort,%20Label,StartYear,StopYear,%20Offset%201,DOB,1955,1965,-1.5%202,DOB,1970,2009,-1.5%203,DOB,1980,1984,-1.5%201,Surveys,1979,2010,-0.5%202,Surveys,1986,2010,-0.5%203,Surveys,1997,2010,-0.5%201,Fertility,1970,2009,0.5%202,Fertility,1987,2010,0.5%203,Fertility,1994,2010,0.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://Cohort,%2520Label,StartYear,StopYear,%2520Offset%25201,DOB,1955,1965,-1.5%25202,DOB,1970,2009,-1.5%25203,DOB,1980,1984,-1.5%25201,Surveys,1979,2010,-0.5%25202,Surveys,1986,2010,-0.5%25203,Surveys,1997,2010,-0.5%25201,Fertility,1970,2009,0.5%25202,Fertility,1987,2010,0.5%25203,Fertility,1994,2010,0.5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031106000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1D_4Mh48Cr31SHYy_mtIn4\">CSV</a> and this <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031106000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U7wJwy1X3pNxkLtjDSTsx\">code</a>.</font></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">There&#39;s a few nonstandard annotations (and a few shortcut that don&#39;t follow best practices).  The meat of the graphing code is:</font></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">ggplot<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> aes<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>xmin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>StartYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> xmax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>StopYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> ymin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> ymax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> fill<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">))</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">  geom_rect<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>color<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">NA</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#The color bars of data; use just the fill</span>    <br></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">  geom_text<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>aes<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>x<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Year<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> y<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Height<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">),</span> hjust<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.5</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The important code that adds to the CSV is</font></span></div></pre></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">width <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.2</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Cohort <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Offset<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">*</span>width </div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> width</div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Height <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Year <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>StartYear <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> pmin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>StopYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2010</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">))</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div></pre><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
