   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Although not quite a formal Gantt chart, there is also the package ‘timeline’ here:  <a href=\"https://github.com/jbryer/timeline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jbryer/timeline&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2o10ROWfOxFND4MCXBi4MT\">https://github.com/jbryer/timeline</a> which has some nice features.  Bryan<div><br><div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div>On Mar 19, 2014, at 3:21 PM, William Beasley &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wibe...@hotmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12px;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To build on Roman&#39;s geom_rect example, this Gantt-ish <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-w33bMj7qQ5FFi6GeXZfV\">graph</a> was created from this <a href=\"http://Cohort,%20Label,StartYear,StopYear,%20Offset%201,DOB,1955,1965,-1.5%202,DOB,1970,2009,-1.5%203,DOB,1980,1984,-1.5%201,Surveys,1979,2010,-0.5%202,Surveys,1986,2010,-0.5%203,Surveys,1997,2010,-0.5%201,Fertility,1970,2009,0.5%202,Fertility,1987,2010,0.5%203,Fertility,1994,2010,0.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://Cohort,%2520Label,StartYear,StopYear,%2520Offset%25201,DOB,1955,1965,-1.5%25202,DOB,1970,2009,-1.5%25203,DOB,1980,1984,-1.5%25201,Surveys,1979,2010,-0.5%25202,Surveys,1986,2010,-0.5%25203,Surveys,1997,2010,-0.5%25201,Fertility,1970,2009,0.5%25202,Fertility,1987,2010,0.5%25203,Fertility,1994,2010,0.5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YFzNTgMiUZAuQ0OmcdvTK\">CSV</a> and this <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00yUn8THiocYxBq4YMv_PX\">code</a>.</font></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">There&#39;s a few nonstandard annotations (and a few shortcut that don&#39;t follow best practices).  The meat of the graphing code is:</font></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">ggplot<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> aes<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>xmin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>StartYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> xmax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>StopYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> ymin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> ymax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMax<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> fill<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">))</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">  geom_rect<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>color<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">NA</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#The color bars of data; use just the fill</span>    <br></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">  geom_text<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>aes<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>x<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Year<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> y<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Height<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">),</span> hjust<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.5</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The important code that adds to the CSV is</font></span></div></pre></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">width <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.2</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Cohort <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Offset<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">*</span>width </div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> width</div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Height <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>Year <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>StartYear <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">+</span> pmin<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>ds<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>StopYear<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2010</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">))</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div></pre><br></div><div><br></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UR7FohduPX000gmUZtQ2h\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2H34SYjgs_mFTzDZCGpAsM\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aPD_rRKbtU7a4teIPZkdn\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>"
