  {
   "id": "D5nGmuL0hrMJ",
   "from": "Brandon Hurr",
   "author": "27405c4b711a1080",
   "date": "2014-03-24T13:43:34Z",
   "subject": "Re: Gant Charts",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I put something together a while back to make Gantt&#39;s in ggplot2, but haven&#39;t updated it in over a year and I&#39;ve not used it much either. Replace the line with the data loading with the GanttDemo file and it should run. <div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>HTH, </div><div>B</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Mar 19, 2014 at 7:26 PM, Bryan Hanson <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">han...@depauw.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Although not quite a formal Gantt chart, there is also the package ‘timeline’ here:  <a href=\"https://github.com/jbryer/timeline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jbryer/timeline&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0i7Um6FxasV4qwhbMXbiZ_\">https://github.com/jbryer/timeline</a> which has some nice features.  Bryan<div>\r\n\r\n<div><div><br><div><div>On Mar 19, 2014, at 3:21 PM, William Beasley &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wibe...@hotmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><pre><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To build on Roman&#39;s geom_rect example, this Gantt-ish <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Py54aA-DLUIM7zrWMSqDU\">graph</a> was created from this <a rel=\"nofollow\">CSV</a> and this <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksDetermination/blob/master/Publications/2013France/Graphs/Timeline.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DQwN18wGDBWdNYRpvl6E0\">code</a>.</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">There&#39;s a few nonstandard annotations (and a few shortcut that don&#39;t follow best practices).  The meat of the graphing code is:</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">ggplot<span>(</span>ds<span>,</span> aes<span>(</span>xmin<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>StartYear<span>,</span> xmax<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>StopYear<span>,</span> ymin<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMin<span>,</span> ymax<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>HeightMax<span>,</span> fill<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span>))</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">  geom_rect<span>(</span>color<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">NA</span><span>)</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#The color bars of data; use just the fill</span>    <br>\r\n\r\n</div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">  geom_text<span>(</span>aes<span>(</span>x<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>Year<span>,</span> y<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>Height<span>,</span> label<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span>Label<span>),</span> hjust<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.5</span><span>)</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\"><span><br></span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The important code that adds to the CSV is</font></span></div>\r\n\r\n</pre></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">width <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">.2</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">\r\n\r\nds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>Cohort <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>Offset<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">*</span>width </div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span> width</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>Height <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span>(</span>ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMax <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span> ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>HeightMin<span>)</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;padding-left:10px\">ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>Year <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span>(</span>ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>StartYear <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span> pmin<span>(</span>ds<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">$</span>StopYear<span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2010</span><span>))</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n</pre><br></div><div><br></div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a3NEmRbnaX23jpNtU5Ecg\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uiC6GEcK1LZUB6VsnHOyj\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3n0qWJxEa9ZR3b37nHDm_z\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div><br></div></div></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a3NEmRbnaX23jpNtU5Ecg\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031114000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3R4dchyWpapBy6OoMRypQW\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371031114000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TuGvBlY7x62NTo-xe6grT\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
